   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Candidate Model 3 — Mini-ResNet (Trained from Scratch)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Model Description & Justification\n",
    "Model 3 is a compact **Residual Network (Mini-ResNet)** built natively for 32×32 images. It begins with a 3×3 stem followed by three residual stages (`32 -> 64 -> 128` filters, two residual blocks per stage). Each residual block uses two 3×3 convolutions with Batch Normalisation and an additive **skip connection** (with a 1×1 projection shortcut whenever spatial dimensions or channel counts change).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Strengths for this task:**\n",
    "- Residual skip connections (He et al., 2016) alleviate vanishing gradients, allowing deeper feature hierarchies to be trained reliably from scratch.\n",
    "- Tests whether residual depth outperforms a plain VGG-style stack (Model 2) under the exact same data augmentation and training budget.\n",
    "- **Reference:** He, K., Zhang, X., Ren, S., & Sun, J. (2016). *Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition*. CVPR."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def residual_block(x, filters, stride=1):\n",
    "    shortcut = x\n",
    "    y = layers.Conv2D(filters, 3, strides=stride, padding='same', use_bias=False)(x)\n",
    "    y = layers.BatchNormalization()(y)\n",
    "    y = layers.Activation('relu')(y)\n",
    "    y = layers.Conv2D(filters, 3, padding='same', use_bias=False)(y)\n",
    "    y = layers.BatchNormalization()(y)\n",
    "    if stride != 1 or shortcut.shape[-1] != filters:\n",
    "        shortcut = layers.Conv2D(filters, 1, strides=stride, use_bias=False)(shortcut)\n",
    "        shortcut = layers.BatchNormalization()(shortcut)\n",
    "    y = layers.Add()([y, shortcut])\n",
    "    return layers.Activation('relu')(y)\n",
    "\n",
    "def build_model3():\n",
    "    inputs = keras.Input(shape=(32, 32, 3))\n",
    "    x = layers.RandomFlip('horizontal')(inputs)\n",
    "    x = layers.RandomRotation(0.05)(x)\n",
    "    x = layers.RandomTranslation(0.1, 0.1)(x)\n",
    "    x = layers.Rescaling(1./255)(x)\n",
    "    x = layers.Conv2D(32, 3, padding='same', use_bias=False)(x)\n",
    "    x = layers.BatchNormalization()(x)\n",
    "    x = layers.Activation('relu')(x)\n",
    "    for stage, filters in enumerate([32, 64, 128]):\n",
    "        for block in range(2):\n",
    "            stride = 2 if (stage > 0 and block == 0) else 1\n",
    "            x = residual_block(x, filters, stride)\n",
    "    x = layers.GlobalAveragePooling2D()(x)\n",
    "    x = layers.Dropout(0.3)(x)\n",
    "    outputs = layers.Dense(NUM_CLASSES, activation='softmax')(x)\n",
    "    return compile_model(keras.Model(inputs, outputs, name='Model3_MiniResNet'), lr=1e-3)\n",
    "\n",
